[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:60. The Future]
[00:00.680]Passage 60 | 文章六十
[00:02.735]The future | 未来
[00:05.190]At a village fair, | 在一个乡村集市上，
[00:08.245]I decided to visit a fortune teller | 我决定去拜访一位算命师，
[00:11.345]called Madam Belinsky. | 她叫贝林斯基夫人。
[00:14.515]I went into her tent, | 我走进她的帐篷，
[00:17.110]and she told me to sit down. | 她叫我坐下。
[00:19.990]After I had given her some money, | 在我给她一些钱之后，
[00:23.120]she looked into a crystal ball | 她看着一个水晶球，
[00:25.970]and said: | 说：
[00:27.510]“A relation of yours | “你的一个亲戚
[00:30.145]is coming to see you. | 要来看你。
[00:32.540]She will be arriving this evening | 她将于今晚抵达，
[00:35.705]and intends to stay for a few days. | 并打算逗留几天。
[00:39.825]The moment you leave this tent, | 你一走出这个帐篷，
[00:43.195]you will get a big surprise. | 你就会得到一个大大的惊喜。
[00:46.140]A woman you know well | 一个你很熟悉的女人
[00:48.820]will rush towards you. | 会向你跑来。
[00:50.955]She will speak to you | 她会和你说话，
[00:53.380]and then she will lead you away from this place. | 然后她会带你离开这个地方。
[00:57.760]That | 就是
[00:58.860]is all.” | 这一切。”
[01:01.290]As soon as I went outside, | 我一出去，
[01:04.920]I forgot all about Madam Belinsky | 我就把贝林斯基夫人的一切都忘了，
[01:07.685]because my wife hurried towards me. | 因为我妻子匆匆向我走来。
[01:11.340]“Where have you been hiding?” | “你一直躲在哪里？”
[01:13.950]she asked impatiently. | 她不耐烦地问。
[01:16.180]“Your sister will be here | “你妹妹就要来了，
[01:18.295]in less than an hour, | 不到一个小时，
[01:19.880]and we must be at the station | 我们必须到车站
[01:21.910]to meet her. | 去接她。
[01:22.970]We are late already.” | 我们已经迟到了。”
[01:25.575]As she walked away, | 当她走开时，
[01:28.045]I followed her out of the fair. | 我跟着她离开了集市。